; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-signed-residues.py; checked native proof terms.
; Positive-modulus affine polynomial, both partial derivatives,
; and the exact source nonsingular condition. The point type has
; one infinity case and affine coordinates carrying nonsingularity,
; so a singular solution is not an affine point of this type.
; As in the source, the derivative criterion is used geometrically over fields.
(#alias less-than = ./natural-order.lim::less-than)
